+pub const INSTRUCTIONS_EXTRA: &str = "Neu in 1.0.8 (aus Secretscript):\n\
+- roblox_studio(action, arguments): sichere High-Level-Aktionen (project_info, get_game_tree, read_instance, read_script, search_scripts, create_part/model/ui/vfx/script/instance_tree, modify_instance, clone_instance, patch_script, set_script_source, delete_*, get_errors). Jede Aenderung legt automatisch einen Snapshot an; rueckgaengig mit action=restore_snapshot.\n\
+- roblox_execute_luau laedt die BW-Helfer automatisch, sobald der Code BW.* nutzt (BW.model, BW.ui, BW.particles, BW.patch, BW.weldAll, BW.leaderstats, BW.logs ...). Optional snapshot_paths.\n\
+- roblox_workflow(category) liefert Playbooks; roblox_project_memory merkt sich wichtige Scripts/GUIs/Systeme pro Place.\n\
